{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20265DFQGnATH41795224188.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>天氣概況：東北季候風正影響廣東。同時，一道廣闊雲帶覆蓋沿岸地區。</p><p></p><p>本港地區今日天氣預測：大致多雲及乾燥。日間部分時間有陽光，最高氣溫約21度。吹和緩至清勁偏北風，稍後轉吹東風。</p><p></p><p>展望：未來一兩日大致多雲，風勢頗大，氣溫略為回升。下週中期氣溫再度下降。</p><p></p><p>06:00 更新</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-21T02:03:57.958099+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":134,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T22:07:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-21T18:28:37.876658+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-21T01:57:21.695701+00:00","content_hash":"18c6f0325c8ca9206196c423802498865a152c764ada2a77c34104e7099d01f0","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-21T02:03:57.958099+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}